ble method for answering complex reporting questions with authoritative support."}, {"id": "3854a9c0-c4ce-4a82-9a6f-a0e44bd7c88d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Public-company reporting context", "children": [{"id": "efc28875-08ae-432e-8cf1-460d853abcf5", "type": "concept", "title": "10-K and 10-Q structure"}, {"id": "e0e93100-ba3f-48ef-9754-87a27fadb751", "type": "concept", "title": "Footnotes, MD&A, accounting policies, and critical estimates"}, {"id": "540b408e-a178-47e2-98c7-f76bf91a699e", "type": "concept", "title": "SEC environment, materiality, and documentation"}], "description": "Students learn where technical accounting appears in real filings and why disclosure quality matters."}]}, {"id": "07634765-556c-4578-bc28-f23eff19ef9c", "type": "topic", "title": "Long-term liabilities, bonds, and debt modifications", "description": "Account for bonds, notes, amortization, extinguishments, covenants, and disclosure of financing obligations.", "children": [{"id": "2789698a-8152-47e2-a924-190a4724fa59", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Bond issuance and amortization", "children": [{"id": "c134863e-d020-49d2-8d03-d9ebcea50284", "type": "concept", "title": "Face value, stated rate, market rate, discount, and premium"}, {"id": "e05a4b2e-dbe3-4c39-8aa4-937acd7564d7", "type": "concept", "title": "Effective-interest method"}, {"id": "370cb9a7-ad09-4e6b-b56c-cabe00ba0d68", "type": "concept", "title": "Issuance costs and carrying amount"}], "description": "Students learn how borrowing terms become balance sheet liabilities and interest expense over time."}, {"id": "18342ccd-a89d-46d8-8ed9-89544e563d74", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Debt extinguishment and modification", "children": [{"id": "90e02ff3-5b03-4a18-9425-b68866d5de2a", "type": "concept", "title": "Early retirement of debt"}, {"id": "f6cbf18b-9b9a-4c94-9410-ec0e7eb4c963", "type": "concept", "title": "Troubled debt restructuring concepts"}, {"id": "48a8ecc8-1d9a-4d61-b10b-e6d0a00726bd", "type": "concept", "title": "Modification versus extinguishment assessment"}], "description": "This subtopic shows how changes in borrowing arrangements affect gain/loss recognition and future interest."}, {"id": "6d90c87a-79bc-44df-ba1a-c86523360d5e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Liability disclosures and risk", "children": [{"id": "99e55966-f404-4dbd-97c5-a25cb7238824", "type": "concept", "title": "Maturity schedules"}, {"id": "f8e5ba2c-5060-409a-9490-f704a37cd468", "type": "concept", "title": "Covenants and defaults"}, {"id": "f5497ebd-2d9e-4b95-b715-2ac532cd2d34", "type": "concept", "title": "Fair value of debt and interest-rate exposure"}], "description": "Students connect debt accounting to liquidity, covenants, maturity risk, and financial statement notes."}]}, {"id": "fa73a8b8-8dfe-4dcd-9542-95de9c34a4ee", "type": "topic", "title": "Stockholders' equity and equity transactions", "description": "Analyze paid-in capital, retained earnings, treasury stock, dividends, and equity statement presentation.", "children": [{"id": "7a1a27a7-7dba-4624-b975-6abf8a68474e", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Contributed capital and retained earnings", "children": [{"id": "09c9fb88-1a6a-4ce8-8db6-438af5869b96", "type": "concept", "title": "Common and preferred stock issuance"}, {"id": "e860a8f3-ff92-474f-a2d8-ab6511e20422", "type": "concept", "title": "Additional paid-in capital"}, {"id": "9f2ba544-8cab-49e6-b984-eee067fa98fe", "type": "concept", "title": "Retained earnings restrictions and appropriations"}], "description": "Students learn how ownership transactions differ from earnings-generating activities."}, {"id": "582469ac-dd54-40eb-8ef5-145666b2aa1c", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Treasury stock and dividends", "children": [{"id": "343a47b0-4acf-4baf-b03f-b53f521c89d6", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost method for treasury shares"}, {"id": "ecc3bd42-2a44-42da-a369-78076393f597", "type": "concept", "title": "Cash, property, scrip, and stock dividends"}, {"id": "437ffb66-af46-4f48-af5b-a5a13c913f40", "t