  title = 'Intermediate Accounting II',
  goal = 'Intermediate Accounting II',
  summary = 'This course develops advanced financial reporting competence for complex liabilities, equity, earnings per share, investments, revenue, income taxes, pensions, leases, accounting changes, errors, and advanced cash-flow issues. Students learn not only the journal entries and calculations, but also how to research authoritative guidance, interpret disclosures, and evaluate reporting choices in real company filings.',
