72deaa1f80", "type": "concept", "title": "If-converted method and antidilution"}], "description": "This subtopic teaches how potential common shares alter per-share performance."}, {"id": "293e1502-a860-41c6-ad7e-2a838ece2659", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Complex capital structures", "children": [{"id": "ec9a3322-f7cc-4fcc-a7ac-5415e3b31559", "type": "concept", "title": "Contingently issuable shares"}, {"id": "f4137a36-ef27-46ca-af40-488e775306ea", "type": "concept", "title": "Share-based compensation links"}, {"id": "b6617366-ad9f-4cbc-afe5-fe554a6ebc0e", "type": "concept", "title": "EPS presentation and reconciliation"}], "description": "Students learn to handle multiple instruments and explain EPS effects in disclosures."}]}, {"id": "78c5b865-39d6-4ea7-b7bd-f6d7af3a53f1", "type": "topic", "title": "Investments in debt and equity securities", "description": "Classify, measure, report, and disclose investment securities, fair value changes, and credit losses.", "children": [{"id": "665c2804-4d93-4c00-adee-afbd1ba394c9", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Classification and measurement", "children": [{"id": "436af417-cffb-4aac-93ea-1c5996649761", "type": "concept", "title": "Trading, available-for-sale, and held-to-maturity debt securities"}, {"id": "e965f525-65f5-432c-836f-5113b7c716f9", "type": "concept", "title": "Equity securities and fair value changes"}, {"id": "668c4cfa-c990-47cc-bb80-550ca112fa2a", "type": "concept", "title": "Amortized cost and effective interest"}], "description": "Students learn how investment intent and cash-flow characteristics drive accounting treatment."}, {"id": "a407a794-19a2-4c51-95ed-1d8c23ed7049", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Fair value and credit losses", "children": [{"id": "8bb62b8e-f2dc-4254-81a4-b8bfa0d42bf9", "type": "concept", "title": "Fair value hierarchy levels 1, 2, and 3"}, {"id": "cf77776b-b206-4fd6-9fd1-8c30b115ad30", "type": "concept", "title": "Unrealized gains/losses and OCI"}, {"id": "cd9cb450-c26a-4d16-baf7-73706